<title>UK: John Laing, Serco chosen for UK labs.</title>
<headline>John Laing, Serco chosen for UK labs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A consortium of John Laing Plc and Serco Group Plc has been chosen as the preferred tenderer to build and operate new laboratories at London's National Physical Laboratory, the British government said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The contract is worth 300 million pounds over 25 years. It will be built under the government's Private Finance Initiative.</p>
</text>
